#: props.py:397
msgid "Initiator polyline (level 0): a straight line or a regular polygon. Polygons are computed on the fly with the side length equal to the total vector, so closed fractals such as the Koch snowflake work with one click. To use your own curve, enable Custom Initiator Curve below"
